## 🔍 Szczegóły Techniczne

### API Rate Limiting
```javascript
const RateLimits = {
  perSecond: 10,
  perMinute: 60,
  perHour: 1000,
  burstSize: 20
};
```

### Cache TTL
```javascript
const CacheTTL = {
  short: 60 * 1000,     // 1 minuta
  medium: 5 * 60 * 1000,  // 5 minut
  long: 15 * 60 * 1000    // 15 minut
};
```

### Retry Policy
```javascript
const RetryConfig = {
  maxAttempts: 3,
  baseDelay: 1000,
  maxDelay: 5000,
  backoffFactor: 2
};
```

